01:08:00.800 --> 01:08:08.420
<v Ira Glass>You know, he has squirrels at his house, in his garden, front yard, doesn't like them. Gets kind of intense about it.

01:08:08.420 --> 01:08:10.820
<v Derenda Hancock>Stay out of the fucking driveway!

